# Force LF line endings for files that must run/parse correctly on Linux,
# regardless of core.autocrlf on a contributor's Windows machine (this repo
# has core.autocrlf=true locally, which silently reintroduces CRLF into
# these files otherwise -- see release/scripts/*.sh CRLF bug, 2026-07-27).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
.env* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
